WEBVTT

01:41.789 --> 01:49.000
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.320 --> 01:51.840
[Episode 8]

01:56.930 --> 02:01.450
[Noticeboard]

01:59.280 --> 02:00.040
Morning.

02:01.450 --> 02:08.710
[Class Challenge Leaderboard]

02:01.950 --> 02:04.540
Morning, coward.

02:08.780 --> 02:13.910
[Honor List]

02:09.080 --> 02:10.710
Early bird today, huh?

02:13.910 --> 02:17.870
[A New Chapter, A New Journey]

02:14.400 --> 02:15.190
Shen.

02:15.560 --> 02:17.840
Are you still playing the silent game?

02:18.800 --> 02:20.430
I can't even be bothered to talk to you.

02:20.430 --> 02:21.280
Coward.

02:23.150 --> 02:24.120
Morning, Zhixia.

02:24.120 --> 02:25.250
Morning, Tingting.

02:25.560 --> 02:26.680
I dreamt last night

02:26.700 --> 02:28.900
that I got thrown off the pendulum ride.

02:29.540 --> 02:31.430
I couldn't sleep at all last night.

02:31.430 --> 02:32.800
I think I have insomnia.

02:33.400 --> 02:36.730
Maybe you were just too excited
from playing during the day.

02:38.840 --> 02:40.640
What happened over the weekend?

02:41.520 --> 02:42.680
That's what you get

02:42.680 --> 02:44.590
for ditching us for piano practice.

02:44.590 --> 02:46.960
So it looks like
things are really moving forward

02:46.960 --> 02:48.490
between you and Lin Zhixia.

02:49.800 --> 02:50.590
Fine.

02:50.840 --> 02:52.560
Since you call yourself

02:52.560 --> 02:53.910
a walking encyclopedia,

02:53.910 --> 02:56.040
let me fill you in on the latest gossip.

02:56.960 --> 02:59.030
Lin Zhixia and I are good friends now.

03:00.320 --> 03:02.000
What exactly did I miss?

03:02.430 --> 03:03.560
You guys left me out!

03:08.630 --> 03:09.430
Come in.

03:10.800 --> 03:11.590
Director.

03:12.680 --> 03:13.810
You wanted to see me?

03:15.080 --> 03:15.910
I wanted to

03:15.910 --> 03:16.870
have a chat with you

03:16.870 --> 03:19.360
about your application
for the experimental class.

03:19.360 --> 03:20.520
Lin Zeqiu,

03:20.750 --> 03:21.710
I think

03:22.000 --> 03:24.910
you are not quite suitable
for the experimental class.

03:24.910 --> 03:25.560
Why?

03:25.560 --> 03:26.710
My grades have already...

03:26.710 --> 03:27.750
I saw your grades.

03:28.430 --> 03:29.210
Look,

03:29.970 --> 03:31.240
your grades this semester have moved up

03:31.240 --> 03:33.000
ten places from last semester.

03:33.000 --> 03:34.710
Excellent! I can see your progress.

03:34.710 --> 03:37.910
But with this much progress,
why am I still not getting in?

03:38.030 --> 03:39.310
I know

03:39.310 --> 03:40.590
what you're asking for.

03:40.590 --> 03:43.000
But the school has its own considerations.

03:43.470 --> 03:44.680
You have good grades,

03:45.150 --> 03:47.360
but you're still getting less than half

03:47.360 --> 03:48.680
of the final questions right.

03:48.680 --> 03:49.680
Here, take a look.

03:54.900 --> 03:56.370
Actually, this experimental class

03:56.370 --> 03:58.970
mainly focuses on the final questions.

03:59.190 --> 04:00.630
I'm afraid you won't be able to keep up,

04:00.630 --> 04:02.560
and it would be too hard to catch up.

04:02.870 --> 04:03.680
So,

04:05.400 --> 04:06.430
I'd suggest

04:06.630 --> 04:09.280
skipping the experimental class for now.

04:09.800 --> 04:11.730
Here, take your application back.

04:12.030 --> 04:15.360
Director, I really want to
get into the experimental class.

04:15.750 --> 04:17.360
Lin Zeqiu.

04:17.950 --> 04:19.310
Don't get the wrong idea.

04:19.310 --> 04:22.840
Success isn't just about
getting into the experimental class.

04:23.540 --> 04:25.330
Say I let you in,

04:25.330 --> 04:26.460
but you can't keep up

04:26.540 --> 04:28.010
and really struggle, what then?

04:28.010 --> 04:29.810
You'd have to transfer back out.

04:29.860 --> 04:32.610
Wouldn't that be a huge blow
to your confidence?

04:33.740 --> 04:34.670
Don't you think?

04:36.330 --> 04:38.590
You know Jin Baihui from Grade 10, right?

04:39.570 --> 04:41.180
She got into
that elite program in Beijing.

04:41.180 --> 04:42.980
And you know what? She couldn't
keep up and had to transfer back.

04:42.980 --> 04:44.640
She even got held back a grade!

04:48.300 --> 04:49.420
Director, please...

04:49.420 --> 04:51.550
Can't you just give me another chance?

04:52.370 --> 04:53.810
Lin Zeqiu.

04:54.620 --> 04:56.659
You are absolutely a promising student.

04:56.659 --> 04:58.100
Just keep up this steady pace,

04:58.100 --> 05:01.060
and you'll definitely
get into your dream university.

05:01.060 --> 05:02.980
As for those final questions,

05:03.220 --> 05:05.860
I've found a great teacher
to help you out.

05:07.890 --> 05:08.660
May I come in?

05:10.300 --> 05:12.220
Yes, it's Lin Zhixia.

05:16.820 --> 05:18.420
I'll be going now, Director.

05:37.330 --> 05:39.690
Brother, what are you so angry about?

05:43.330 --> 05:44.530
You're a big shot now,

05:44.860 --> 05:47.790
acting like my teacher
right in front of the teacher.

05:50.010 --> 05:51.690
I told Director Sui

05:52.010 --> 05:54.130
that you definitely
wouldn't let me tutor you.

05:54.130 --> 05:55.570
I only came because he said

05:55.570 --> 05:57.230
he'd talk some sense into you.

05:58.180 --> 06:01.540
Besides, I really can help you
with the final questions.

06:04.570 --> 06:05.830
I don't need your help.

06:09.370 --> 06:10.370
Brother, wait.

06:16.050 --> 06:18.480
You left the office in such a hurry.

06:18.810 --> 06:19.680
Director Sui asked me

06:19.680 --> 06:22.810
to return your application
for the experimental class.

06:25.980 --> 06:26.840
I don't want it.

06:27.180 --> 06:28.310
Throw it away for me.

06:28.980 --> 06:29.770
Also,

06:30.770 --> 06:32.860
don't call me brother at school.

06:54.130 --> 06:54.930
Lin Zhixia.

07:07.970 --> 07:09.900
Why aren't you going back to class?

07:13.450 --> 07:15.450
Hurry up, you're going to be late.

07:20.900 --> 07:22.330
Let's continue.

07:22.600 --> 07:24.100
Regarding the changes

07:24.100 --> 07:25.010
in this graph,

07:25.010 --> 07:26.670
and the t-axis, specifically

07:26.740 --> 07:27.690
whether v is positive or negative,

07:27.690 --> 07:29.490
does anyone have any questions?

07:29.860 --> 07:32.220
Alright. Now that
we're clear on this, let's move on.

07:32.220 --> 07:33.570
The direction of motion

07:33.570 --> 07:35.500
depends on which quadrant it's in.

07:35.500 --> 07:37.370
When v is above the t-axis, it's positive;

07:37.370 --> 07:38.300
and when it's below the t-axis...

07:38.300 --> 07:39.100
Lin Zhixia.

07:40.300 --> 07:41.420
What's

07:41.770 --> 07:42.770
in that envelope?

07:43.890 --> 07:44.690
Nothing.

07:48.690 --> 07:50.250
I saw everything today.

07:52.300 --> 07:55.100
Besides, aren't we best friends?

07:57.890 --> 08:01.010
Can I just take a peek at it?

08:03.570 --> 08:04.900
Sorry, I really can't.

08:06.300 --> 08:08.300
The larger the k value is,

08:08.500 --> 08:09.180
the greater

08:09.180 --> 08:11.860
the acceleration a

08:11.860 --> 08:12.770
it represents.

08:13.930 --> 08:14.930
Lin.

08:18.060 --> 08:20.300
I have a few words I want to say to you.

08:23.930 --> 08:24.930
I don't like

08:25.810 --> 08:27.610
girls who only know how to study.

08:27.860 --> 08:30.250
But I've really liked you
for a very long time.

08:30.250 --> 08:32.610
If you think
I'm too focused on my studies,

08:33.580 --> 08:35.220
I can change for you.

08:35.409 --> 08:37.140
I'll stop studying, I promise!

08:38.580 --> 08:39.370
No.

08:40.860 --> 08:42.100
No way.

08:43.890 --> 08:45.170
Lin, hold on a second.

08:49.740 --> 08:51.290
This is how I feel.

08:51.890 --> 08:53.340
It's all in the letter.

08:54.130 --> 08:55.620
Please read it carefully.

08:55.890 --> 08:57.370
Just keep it.

08:59.250 --> 09:00.050
And

09:00.770 --> 09:02.250
leave me alone from now on.

10:05.740 --> 10:06.530
Lin Zhixia.

10:08.370 --> 10:09.170
What's wrong?

10:09.580 --> 10:11.180
You look totally spaced out.

10:12.250 --> 10:13.980
It's all because of my brother.

10:15.620 --> 10:16.410
Lin Zeqiu?

10:16.410 --> 10:17.580
Don't point.

10:19.100 --> 10:21.900
He doesn't want me to say
he's my brother at school.

10:22.010 --> 10:22.820
Why?

10:25.130 --> 10:26.410
He's just being shy.

10:31.740 --> 10:33.200
I mean, he's annoying too,

10:33.220 --> 10:35.720
but please don't tell anyone
he's my brother.

10:35.720 --> 10:37.250
He'll nag me if he finds out.

10:38.440 --> 10:40.050
Why?

10:40.220 --> 10:42.050
Why does he get to decide?

10:42.370 --> 10:43.740
If I had a sister like you,

10:43.740 --> 10:45.800
I'd be shouting it from the rooftops.

10:45.820 --> 10:47.270
But he won't even say you're his sister?

10:47.270 --> 10:48.100
No way.

10:48.220 --> 10:49.860
I'm taking you to confront him.

10:49.860 --> 10:50.660
Confront him?

10:51.620 --> 10:53.650
Right now,
while everyone's around during the break.

10:53.650 --> 10:54.250
This

10:54.250 --> 10:56.380
needs to be sorted out once and for all.

10:57.860 --> 10:58.650
Zhixia.

10:58.740 --> 11:00.580
Is that the guy you like?

11:00.700 --> 11:02.050
Don't point.

11:02.500 --> 11:04.340
What if someone notices?

11:04.740 --> 11:07.770
He is really handsome and charming.

11:08.530 --> 11:10.190
Why don't you just go tell him?

11:10.370 --> 11:11.460
There's no time like the present.

11:11.460 --> 11:12.460
Let's do it today.

11:12.530 --> 11:13.530
No.

11:14.170 --> 11:16.370
I'm not ready yet.

11:16.700 --> 11:18.460
Besides, what if I get rejected

11:18.860 --> 11:20.460
in front of all these people?

11:21.620 --> 11:22.410
Come on!

11:22.430 --> 11:23.290
No.

11:23.580 --> 11:24.980
I already promised him.

11:24.980 --> 11:26.010
No, you won't.

11:26.010 --> 11:27.410
Let's go.

11:27.410 --> 11:28.220
I don't want to.

11:28.220 --> 11:29.220
-No.
-Come on.

11:29.220 --> 11:30.250
Let's go.

11:30.250 --> 11:32.130
I really can't.
He'll be furious if I go over.

11:32.130 --> 11:32.860
Lin Zhixia.

11:37.940 --> 11:38.740
I...

11:41.050 --> 11:42.650
I have a question I can't solve.

11:42.650 --> 11:43.710
Help me take a look.

12:04.580 --> 12:05.370
Lin Zhixia.

12:06.410 --> 12:08.220
Is something bothering you?

12:09.250 --> 12:10.050
No.

12:14.340 --> 12:15.410
I just feel that...

12:17.250 --> 12:18.700
Life is long,

12:19.130 --> 12:20.730
and we will meet many people.

12:21.130 --> 12:21.980
But,

12:22.220 --> 12:23.580
we should do what is appropriate

12:23.580 --> 12:24.820
for our age.

12:25.100 --> 12:26.220
At our age,

12:26.220 --> 12:28.130
the most important thing is studying.

12:28.130 --> 12:29.650
So we can't let anything

12:29.980 --> 12:31.580
interfere with our studies.

12:34.940 --> 12:36.800
Why are you suddenly saying this?

12:38.050 --> 12:39.170
I know that.

12:43.290 --> 12:44.250
Glad you know.

12:50.790 --> 12:53.610
[Astronomy Club Recruitment]

13:06.220 --> 13:07.890
[Astronomy Club Recruitment]

13:12.440 --> 13:17.470
[Astronomy Club Recruitment]

13:17.570 --> 13:19.950
[Astronomy Club]

13:35.050 --> 13:35.860
What is it?

13:37.410 --> 13:39.270
I want to join the astronomy club.

13:40.050 --> 13:40.860
Your reason?

13:41.940 --> 13:43.820
I'm very interested in astronomy.

13:43.820 --> 13:45.500
I've loved watching the stars
since I was little.

13:45.500 --> 13:46.410
I've even read

13:47.250 --> 13:49.940
The Flammarion Book of Astronomy.

13:50.100 --> 13:50.890
Really?

13:51.580 --> 13:53.620
Then tell me, last Wednesday night,

13:53.860 --> 13:56.720
what was the brightest star
next to the moon called?

14:01.340 --> 14:01.980
Po...

14:02.940 --> 14:03.740
Polaris.

14:03.890 --> 14:05.100
Last Wednesday was a new moon.

14:05.100 --> 14:06.500
You couldn't see the moon at all.

14:06.500 --> 14:07.650
Polaris is always due north.

14:07.650 --> 14:08.940
It can't possibly be next to the moon.

14:08.940 --> 14:10.250
So what exactly is your reason

14:10.250 --> 14:12.050
for joining the astronomy club?

14:14.130 --> 14:15.620
I just want to join.

14:15.770 --> 14:17.580
Everyone can join the astronomy club.

14:17.580 --> 14:18.700
It's my right.

14:20.130 --> 14:21.290
Let me correct you.

14:21.620 --> 14:23.700
Not everyone can join the astronomy club,

14:23.700 --> 14:26.290
but everyone can apply for it.

14:26.890 --> 14:27.820
However, deciding whether someone

14:27.820 --> 14:29.290
is qualified to join

14:29.290 --> 14:31.100
is my duty as the vice president.

14:34.050 --> 14:36.700
Have you heard of
that girl named Lin Zhixia?

14:37.980 --> 14:39.640
Yeah, why? What's up with her?

14:39.770 --> 14:41.220
I heard her IQ is super high.

14:41.220 --> 14:43.010
She's been top of her class
since she was little,

14:43.010 --> 14:45.460
and she's amazing at
mathematical modeling.

14:45.460 --> 14:46.100
Is she?

14:47.100 --> 14:48.830
Isn't our club short of people?

14:48.890 --> 14:50.740
If she could join our club,

14:50.890 --> 14:53.100
at the year-end club selection,

14:53.100 --> 14:54.760
we'd definitely win an award.

14:54.860 --> 14:56.890
She's a good student,

14:57.250 --> 14:59.220
but that doesn't mean
she knows anything about astronomy.

14:59.220 --> 15:00.410
Maybe she's just

15:00.410 --> 15:02.500
a naturally gifted all-rounder.

15:03.820 --> 15:05.740
We're an astronomy club,

15:05.740 --> 15:06.500
not a training class.

15:06.500 --> 15:07.900
Not just anyone can join.

15:09.860 --> 15:11.320
Why are you overreacting?

15:12.740 --> 15:14.130
No, I mean,

15:14.220 --> 15:16.210
our recruitment flyers
are already out there.

15:16.210 --> 15:17.460
We'll definitely
get some promising students,

15:17.460 --> 15:18.790
so don't worry too much.

15:20.010 --> 15:21.980
Well, you're the vice president.

15:22.130 --> 15:23.770
Go find Lin Zhixia and ask her.

15:23.770 --> 15:25.820
If she's willing, that's great.

15:25.820 --> 15:27.240
If not,

15:27.240 --> 15:28.740
we won't force her.

15:30.530 --> 15:31.130
Me?

15:31.130 --> 15:32.170
It's all for the club,

15:32.170 --> 15:33.250
so don't refuse.

15:33.340 --> 15:34.100
I'm leaving.

16:03.620 --> 16:04.950
What's wrong, Brother?

16:05.050 --> 16:05.860
Nothing.

16:07.820 --> 16:09.620
I just came out to get some water.

16:17.250 --> 16:18.580
Got a question for me?

16:19.130 --> 16:19.940
No.

16:20.290 --> 16:21.620
I'm just thirsty.

16:22.820 --> 16:23.580
Go on.

16:46.770 --> 16:48.980
I just saw on the notice board

16:49.050 --> 16:51.500
that the astronomy club is recruiting.

16:51.770 --> 16:52.650
I didn't know our school

16:52.650 --> 16:54.460
had such an advanced club.

16:56.130 --> 16:57.820
What, isn't the basketball team
keeping you busy enough?

16:57.820 --> 16:59.370
Now you're into astronomy too?

16:59.370 --> 17:02.130
How could I even dream of
joining such an advanced club?

17:02.130 --> 17:03.890
Lin Zhixia, I just think

17:03.890 --> 17:05.619
this is quite suitable for you.

17:05.619 --> 17:11.290
[Please Keep Quiet in the Library]

17:07.740 --> 17:10.460
I haven't thought about
joining a club, actually.

17:10.460 --> 17:11.770
But we've always had a subscription

17:11.770 --> 17:13.010
to astronomy magazines.

17:12.829 --> 17:15.859
[Please Keep Quiet in the Library]

17:14.010 --> 17:15.740
The astronomy club...

17:17.180 --> 17:18.310
sounds pretty cool.

17:18.420 --> 17:19.220
Right?

17:32.220 --> 17:33.680
The starlight in your eyes

17:35.290 --> 17:37.460
is the atoms born 13.8 billion years ago

17:37.460 --> 17:39.850
during the Big Bang,

17:40.570 --> 17:41.980
traveling through time and space

17:41.980 --> 17:45.180
just to light up my eyes at this moment.

18:00.420 --> 18:01.290
Lin Zhixia?

18:04.940 --> 18:06.330
You must be Lin Zhixia.

18:08.250 --> 18:11.050
I'm Ye Wenxi,
the president of the astronomy club.

18:11.380 --> 18:12.180
Hello.

18:12.180 --> 18:13.010
Hello.

18:13.500 --> 18:15.050
I really want you

18:15.050 --> 18:16.580
to join our astronomy club.

18:16.660 --> 18:18.610
I heard you're also very good at math.

18:18.610 --> 18:21.090
Actually, the core of astronomy is math.

18:21.220 --> 18:23.750
I think you fit the vibe
of our club perfectly.

18:24.180 --> 18:25.420
I'm not sure

18:25.770 --> 18:27.850
if I have the energy to join a club.

18:30.500 --> 18:31.290
President.

18:31.740 --> 18:34.050
Is your astronomy club basically just

18:34.220 --> 18:35.820
about stargazing and stuff?

18:37.290 --> 18:40.180
Of course,
observation is a huge part of it.

18:40.500 --> 18:42.010
But we also have

18:42.010 --> 18:42.980
our ultimate trump card,

18:42.980 --> 18:44.510
which we don't easily show.

18:45.140 --> 18:46.810
We have
an intern observation access account

18:46.810 --> 18:48.770
for the Purple Mountain Observatory.

18:48.770 --> 18:49.240
Really?

18:49.290 --> 18:50.020
Yes, really.

18:51.380 --> 18:54.770
But it's strictly for club members only.

18:58.980 --> 19:00.180
Don't hesitate.

19:00.180 --> 19:01.700
I asked Lin Zeqiu to find you

19:01.700 --> 19:03.900
just so you could join us
as soon as possible.

19:03.900 --> 19:05.380
He didn't mention it to me.

19:05.530 --> 19:06.460
He didn't?

19:06.850 --> 19:08.380
Impossible. I told him.

19:12.250 --> 19:13.050
It doesn't matter.

19:13.050 --> 19:15.780
I'm officially inviting you
to join our club now.

19:17.810 --> 19:19.220
Then let me think about it.

19:19.220 --> 19:19.940
Okay.

19:20.330 --> 19:22.990
The astronomy club's door
is always open to you.

19:29.610 --> 19:30.940
The president invited you personally.

19:30.940 --> 19:31.850
What's there to think about?

19:31.850 --> 19:33.010
Don't you want to go?

19:35.050 --> 19:36.420
I do want to go.

19:41.330 --> 19:42.140
But what if...

19:43.330 --> 19:44.570
I mean, what if

19:45.290 --> 19:46.950
someone doesn't want me to go?

19:48.090 --> 19:50.140
Who dares to stop you? Let him try.

19:50.250 --> 19:51.660
I'll go straight to him

19:51.660 --> 19:53.140
and reason with him.

19:53.850 --> 19:55.510
There really is such a person.

19:58.360 --> 19:59.820
It's fine, I'll handle it.

20:00.090 --> 20:01.770
Who? Come on, tell me!

20:02.180 --> 20:03.180
Do your homework.

20:05.810 --> 20:06.700
Oh, I forgot.

20:21.500 --> 20:22.360
Tang Tingting.

20:22.850 --> 20:24.180
Can I ask you something?

20:24.420 --> 20:25.350
Yeah, what is it?

20:28.460 --> 20:29.570
Is something

20:30.220 --> 20:31.620
going on with Lin Zhixia?

20:33.420 --> 20:35.290
Did you notice something?

20:36.610 --> 20:38.940
I just think
she's been acting weird lately.

20:38.940 --> 20:41.740
Does it have anything to do
with an upperclassman?

20:41.940 --> 20:42.740
No!

20:42.980 --> 20:45.090
I mean, it's no big deal, really.

20:45.330 --> 20:46.730
So something did happen?

20:48.700 --> 20:49.660
I promised her

20:49.660 --> 20:52.460
I wouldn't tell anyone
about their relationship.

20:52.570 --> 20:54.570
Relationship? What relationship?

20:56.610 --> 20:57.900
Why don't you ask her?

21:02.570 --> 21:03.380
She used to

21:04.180 --> 21:05.910
tell me everything right away.

21:06.980 --> 21:08.310
But this time, nothing.

21:08.700 --> 21:09.830
I was just wondering

21:10.140 --> 21:12.200
if she was keeping something from me.

21:13.290 --> 21:14.610
She's super smart,

21:14.740 --> 21:16.800
but she trusts people way too easily.

21:17.980 --> 21:20.380
I'm afraid she's being taken advantage of.

21:22.330 --> 21:23.420
I think

21:23.740 --> 21:24.530
she kept it from you

21:24.530 --> 21:26.460
because it's her own business.

21:26.660 --> 21:28.380
I mean, we're all teenagers.

21:28.570 --> 21:30.610
It's totally normal
for things like this to happen.

21:30.610 --> 21:31.570
But you don't need to worry too much.

21:31.570 --> 21:32.650
She won't be taken advantage of.

21:32.650 --> 21:33.810
I've already given her some advice.

21:33.810 --> 21:35.340
It should be resolved soon.

21:36.380 --> 21:37.180
Alright.

21:38.220 --> 21:40.420
If she needs any help,

21:41.610 --> 21:43.270
please let me know right away.

21:49.420 --> 21:52.010
Something still feels off.

21:59.980 --> 22:00.770
Lin Zeqiu.

22:08.050 --> 22:09.000
What are you doing here?

22:09.000 --> 22:09.940
Go.

22:13.460 --> 22:14.380
What's wrong?

22:17.500 --> 22:19.660
The president of your astronomy club
asked you to recruit me.

22:19.660 --> 22:21.050
Why didn't you tell me?

22:23.330 --> 22:24.930
Are you trying to keep me out?

22:25.380 --> 22:26.700
I'm afraid that

22:27.090 --> 22:27.980
if we're in the same club,

22:27.980 --> 22:30.570
it'll be too easy for people
to figure out we're siblings.

22:30.570 --> 22:33.700
So just because you're
afraid of being found out, you...

22:34.810 --> 22:37.250
you're killing your own sister's passion?

22:37.570 --> 22:39.010
I didn't mean that.

22:39.810 --> 22:40.610
How about this?

22:40.610 --> 22:42.140
You join, and I'll quit, okay?

22:42.140 --> 22:42.940
No!

22:44.220 --> 22:45.570
You love astronomy just as much as I do.

22:45.570 --> 22:46.810
I don't want you to give up for me.

22:46.810 --> 22:48.290
It's not about giving up.

22:48.530 --> 22:49.220
I...

22:49.900 --> 22:52.160
Anyway, we just can't be in the same club.

22:52.420 --> 22:53.090
Brother,

22:54.010 --> 22:56.530
the real issue isn't the club.

22:56.810 --> 22:57.980
It's that you're trying to hide the fact

22:57.980 --> 22:59.250
that we're siblings.

22:59.250 --> 23:00.570
I just don't get it.

23:00.570 --> 23:01.660
Why are you so afraid of

23:01.660 --> 23:03.420
people knowing I'm your sister?

23:03.420 --> 23:04.900
Keep it down! People are gonna hear us!

23:04.900 --> 23:05.460
Let them hear!

23:05.460 --> 23:06.700
Once everyone knows I'm your sister,

23:06.700 --> 23:07.850
problem solved!

23:07.850 --> 23:08.460
Okay.

23:08.460 --> 23:10.250
Can I explain it to you properly?

23:10.250 --> 23:12.010
Now is not the time to talk about this.

23:12.010 --> 23:14.140
This is a very direct way
to solve the problem.

23:14.140 --> 23:15.250
Go tell your classmates.

23:15.250 --> 23:16.140
If you won't, I will.

23:16.140 --> 23:17.250
No. Let's go somewhere else.

23:17.250 --> 23:18.810
I'll explain it to you properly
somewhere else.

23:18.810 --> 23:19.380
Let's go.

23:19.380 --> 23:20.380
You always do this.

23:20.380 --> 23:21.050
I'll explain it to you.

23:21.050 --> 23:21.850
-Why?
-Let's go somewhere else.

23:21.850 --> 23:22.900
I'll explain it to you somewhere else.

23:22.900 --> 23:23.740
Just say it right here.

23:23.740 --> 23:25.270
Not here. Please, not here.

23:25.440 --> 23:26.970
Why are you bullying a girl?

23:27.220 --> 23:29.010
What's it to you?

23:29.010 --> 23:30.290
So you think you're right to bully her?

23:30.290 --> 23:31.420
Who's bullying her?

23:31.610 --> 23:33.010
You bother Lin Zhixia every day, okay?

23:33.010 --> 23:34.420
You're the one bothering her!

23:34.420 --> 23:34.980
Say that again.

23:34.980 --> 23:36.010
I've been sick of you for a long time.

23:36.010 --> 23:37.180
I'm sick of you too.

23:37.180 --> 23:38.290
What? You wanna fight?

23:38.290 --> 23:38.850
Bring it on!

23:38.850 --> 23:40.310
Lin Zeqiu, we'll help you.

23:41.810 --> 23:43.350
What, you think having more guys
makes you tough?

23:43.350 --> 23:45.270
-Yeah, it does.
-Sophomores bullying people, huh?

23:45.270 --> 23:46.440
Stop fighting!

23:46.920 --> 23:48.780
-Bad news!
-Watch my broom skill!

23:48.880 --> 23:50.090
Jiang Yubai is fighting
with the sophomores!

23:50.090 --> 23:51.140
Who cares if they're sophomores?

23:51.140 --> 23:52.500
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

23:55.350 --> 23:56.250
Stop fighting!

23:56.550 --> 23:57.410
Stop fighting!

23:57.590 --> 23:58.920
Stop fighting!

23:59.880 --> 24:00.440
Brother.

24:00.440 --> 24:01.100
Duan Qiyan.

24:01.270 --> 24:02.200
You're here too?

24:02.290 --> 24:03.480
Watch yourself. Don't get hurt.

24:03.480 --> 24:04.570
You too. Stay safe.

24:13.940 --> 24:14.940
Stop fighting!

24:15.140 --> 24:16.460
Calm down, everyone!

24:20.220 --> 24:21.050
At that time,

24:21.250 --> 24:22.550
I stood outside the crowd,

24:22.550 --> 24:24.210
watching this chaotic scene.

24:24.790 --> 24:26.850
I suddenly felt it was absurd and sad.

24:27.940 --> 24:30.050
Because of this unprovoked broom fight,

24:30.050 --> 24:32.290
my friends and I ended up

24:32.290 --> 24:33.820
getting publicly scolded.

24:34.350 --> 24:35.150
And of course,

24:35.460 --> 24:36.480
Lin Zeqiu too.

24:37.750 --> 24:38.950
But I've always known

24:39.720 --> 24:41.920
that Zeqiu and I shouldn't be like this.

24:42.850 --> 24:44.070
I just don't get it.

24:44.850 --> 24:46.830
What exactly is wrong

24:47.240 --> 24:48.440
between Zeqiu and me?

25:01.010 --> 25:04.220
I actually knew
Lin Zeqiu was your brother all along.

25:05.980 --> 25:06.940
No way.

25:07.660 --> 25:09.740
You didn't seem to know at all.

25:14.570 --> 25:15.420
You guys

25:16.050 --> 25:18.380
don't act like normal brother and sister.

25:22.090 --> 25:23.530
He wasn't like this before.

25:23.530 --> 25:24.730
He was very good to me.

25:25.050 --> 25:26.050
When we were kids,

25:26.740 --> 25:29.250
his friends would always
come over to play with him.

25:29.250 --> 25:30.710
He really wanted to go out,

25:31.250 --> 25:33.510
but I didn't have many friends back then.

25:33.530 --> 25:35.530
So I would beg him to stay home with me.

25:35.530 --> 25:36.900
He would actually stay home

25:36.900 --> 25:38.960
and play cat's cradle with me all day.

25:39.380 --> 25:40.250
Cat's cradle?

25:42.770 --> 25:43.970
What a great brother.

25:48.090 --> 25:49.690
There was also this one time,

25:49.770 --> 25:51.460
he thought he was dying,

25:51.610 --> 25:52.940
so he wrote a will.

25:53.220 --> 25:54.740
It said,

25:55.610 --> 25:57.460
"My sister is a crybaby.

25:57.940 --> 26:00.850
Mom, Dad, please look out for her

26:00.850 --> 26:01.850
and comfort her."

26:02.330 --> 26:03.140
Also,

26:03.420 --> 26:05.850
he left his favorite piggy bank

26:05.850 --> 26:06.740
and car model

26:06.740 --> 26:07.810
to me.

26:08.500 --> 26:10.740
Later, no matter how bad his temper was

26:10.740 --> 26:11.900
or how mean his words were,

26:11.900 --> 26:13.460
whenever I thought of this,

26:13.810 --> 26:14.900
I felt

26:15.530 --> 26:16.860
he definitely loved me.

26:19.090 --> 26:20.530
When did you

26:20.530 --> 26:22.420
start drifting apart?

26:23.330 --> 26:25.260
Probably after we started school.

26:26.740 --> 26:29.340
He was probably
just stressed out from school,

26:29.500 --> 26:31.140
so he barely spoke to me.

26:32.050 --> 26:33.250
He studied very hard,

26:33.740 --> 26:35.010
always staying up until midnight.

26:35.010 --> 26:36.220
I felt bad for him.

26:36.570 --> 26:37.850
I always wanted to tutor him

26:37.850 --> 26:38.780
and help him out.

26:39.050 --> 26:41.250
But he would be incredibly fierce to me.

26:42.420 --> 26:44.140
After I went to high school,

26:44.250 --> 26:45.700
it got even worse.

26:46.290 --> 26:48.820
The night before school started,
he warned me

26:49.290 --> 26:51.290
not to call him my brother at school.

26:52.010 --> 26:53.740
I really don't understand why.

26:56.570 --> 26:58.030
After hearing your story,

26:58.570 --> 27:00.010
I think I know why.

27:01.660 --> 27:02.420
Why?

27:05.090 --> 27:06.090
Maybe because of

27:07.130 --> 27:07.740
his pride.

27:07.850 --> 27:08.460
Pride?

27:08.940 --> 27:09.590
Why?

27:11.380 --> 27:13.640
Having such an excellent younger sister

27:13.740 --> 27:15.460
must be quite stressful.

27:16.810 --> 27:17.670
Think about it.

27:18.050 --> 27:19.500
I used to feel pressured

27:19.500 --> 27:20.940
because of your excellence too.

27:20.940 --> 27:23.070
I felt that only by catching up with you

27:23.500 --> 27:25.830
would I be qualified
to stand by your side.

27:25.980 --> 27:27.980
Your brother must feel the same way.

27:28.050 --> 27:30.090
He hopes that one day he can be worthy of

27:30.090 --> 27:32.020
the title of Lin Zhixia's brother.

27:33.010 --> 27:34.810
I think only then will he proudly

27:34.850 --> 27:36.980
shout it from the rooftops.

27:39.850 --> 27:40.810
Really?

27:56.700 --> 27:57.330
Look.

27:57.940 --> 27:59.270
Do they look like stars?

28:01.660 --> 28:02.860
A long, long time ago,

28:03.330 --> 28:05.050
when people connected stars

28:05.220 --> 28:06.620
to form constellations,

28:07.140 --> 28:09.400
they chose stars of similar brightness.

28:10.310 --> 28:11.170
Think about it.

28:11.590 --> 28:13.200
If the person you love

28:13.310 --> 28:15.750
is the brightest star in the night sky,

28:16.200 --> 28:17.480
of course you'd want to work hard

28:17.480 --> 28:18.940
to shine just as brightly.

28:20.200 --> 28:22.860
That way, you can be discovered
at the same time,

28:22.920 --> 28:23.750
be defined,

28:25.200 --> 28:27.260
and exist in the same constellation.

28:33.310 --> 28:34.110
I get it.

28:37.110 --> 28:38.400
I need to find some time

28:38.830 --> 28:40.360
to have a real talk with him.

28:40.880 --> 28:41.880
But I need to

28:43.400 --> 28:45.240
figure out the right way to do it.

28:47.270 --> 28:48.200
You are so smart.

28:48.480 --> 28:50.140
I'm sure you can figure it out.

29:01.400 --> 29:02.200
Jiang Yubai.

29:02.750 --> 29:04.210
I've realized something.

29:07.440 --> 29:09.350
I feel happy seeing you every day.

29:10.550 --> 29:12.550
I am just an ordinary deep learning

29:12.550 --> 29:14.150
artificial neural network.

29:14.880 --> 29:16.720
My objective function

29:16.920 --> 29:19.750
is simply to maximize my own happiness.

29:20.640 --> 29:22.310
Whenever I lean towards you,

29:23.240 --> 29:24.640
I get positive feedback.

29:24.720 --> 29:25.480
So...

29:25.480 --> 29:26.440
So, Lin Zhixia,

29:27.810 --> 29:28.740
get to the point.

29:35.070 --> 29:35.930
You're so nice.

29:40.880 --> 29:42.270
I try.

29:54.310 --> 29:56.240
What are you doing with that brush?

29:58.110 --> 29:59.310
What do you want to do?

30:01.880 --> 30:04.070
What are you doing? Are you crazy?

30:04.160 --> 30:05.480
I'm going to wipe all this out!

30:05.480 --> 30:06.790
Stop it! Stop it!

30:06.790 --> 30:07.790
Why?

30:09.590 --> 30:10.920
What are you doing?

30:11.240 --> 30:13.550
Stop it!

30:15.310 --> 30:16.110
Give it to me!

30:16.230 --> 30:16.920
Give it to me!

30:16.920 --> 30:18.510
Let go! Let go!

30:18.510 --> 30:19.830
Ouch... my hand!

30:21.480 --> 30:23.680
I...

30:23.790 --> 30:25.270
Did I hurt your hand?

30:27.480 --> 30:28.920
I didn't mean it,

30:28.920 --> 30:30.110
but you were wrong in the first place.

30:30.110 --> 30:32.110
Why did you mess with that painting?

30:32.350 --> 30:33.510
We painted that together
when we were kids.

30:33.510 --> 30:34.710
What if you ruined it?

30:34.880 --> 30:36.480
I don't want to be your sister anymore.

30:36.480 --> 30:37.940
I want to cut ties with you.

30:39.920 --> 30:41.450
What are you talking about?

30:41.750 --> 30:42.680
What do you mean?

30:42.790 --> 30:44.440
Other brothers know how to spoil

30:44.440 --> 30:45.110
and protect their sisters.

30:45.110 --> 30:47.440
And you? You never
have a nice thing to say to me.

30:47.440 --> 30:49.270
I don't mind
that my classmates don't play with me,

30:49.270 --> 30:51.240
but my own brother
avoids me, pushes me away,

30:51.240 --> 30:52.160
and hates me.

30:52.350 --> 30:54.160
What did I do wrong?

30:54.200 --> 30:55.860
Am I that embarrassing to you?

30:59.270 --> 31:00.480
Let me explain.

31:00.480 --> 31:01.750
I don't think that way.

31:06.550 --> 31:07.480
I feel like

31:10.590 --> 31:11.880
I embarrassed you.

31:15.160 --> 31:17.020
Look, you're such a good student.

31:17.110 --> 31:18.910
You study for just a few minutes,

31:19.790 --> 31:21.650
and I have to study all night long.

31:22.720 --> 31:24.160
We share the same parents

31:24.160 --> 31:25.200
and the same genes,

31:25.200 --> 31:27.530
but I just feel like
I'm not as smart as you.

31:29.640 --> 31:31.790
Being dumb just means working harder.

31:33.640 --> 31:34.880
I thought one day

31:34.920 --> 31:37.030
I could work my way
into this experimental class.

31:37.030 --> 31:38.070
Then people would stop saying

31:38.070 --> 31:39.920
Lin Zhixia's brother is a dumb brother.

31:39.920 --> 31:41.400
-I...
-What a fool!

31:43.240 --> 31:44.030
You're too dumb to know

31:44.030 --> 31:46.960
the randomness and diversity
of gene combinations.

31:47.110 --> 31:48.960
You're so silly that you don't even know

31:48.960 --> 31:50.920
how many strengths
and talents are in your genes.

31:50.920 --> 31:52.070
You're so silly to think

31:52.070 --> 31:54.200
that you would embarrass your sister.

31:54.350 --> 31:55.350
So silly!

31:59.030 --> 32:00.480
I was just thinking,

32:00.480 --> 32:02.000
if you had a brother

32:03.830 --> 32:04.830
who was smart,

32:05.750 --> 32:06.720
had a great personality,

32:06.720 --> 32:07.550
played basketball well,

32:07.550 --> 32:10.200
and wasn't totally ugly,

32:11.550 --> 32:12.880
you'd be pretty proud too, right?

32:12.880 --> 32:15.540
Why would I think about
such impossible things?

32:18.400 --> 32:20.000
You'd better take that back.

32:22.200 --> 32:23.350
What I mean is,

32:24.830 --> 32:25.590
to me, you are already

32:25.590 --> 32:27.750
very, very, very excellent.

32:28.750 --> 32:30.070
I want to tell everyone

32:30.070 --> 32:31.750
that Lin Zeqiu is my brother.

32:31.880 --> 32:33.740
Not because you have good grades.

32:34.160 --> 32:36.400
Not because
you are good at all kinds of sports.

32:36.400 --> 32:38.260
And not because you are handsome.

32:38.640 --> 32:40.110
It's because you are

32:40.110 --> 32:42.480
the one and only Lin Zeqiu in this world,

32:42.920 --> 32:44.920
and the person who loves me the most.

32:50.240 --> 32:50.960
I know.

32:51.070 --> 32:52.440
Don't cry, don't cry.

32:52.440 --> 32:53.970
Why are you being so cheesy?

32:55.030 --> 32:55.890
No more crying.

32:56.350 --> 32:58.480
But you just wanted to cut ties with me!

32:58.550 --> 33:00.110
I just wanted to hear the truth from you

33:00.110 --> 33:01.200
and talk to you.

33:01.550 --> 33:03.680
I couldn't bear to erase those things.

33:05.550 --> 33:06.550
Is your hand okay?

33:07.270 --> 33:08.070
I fooled you.

33:09.510 --> 33:10.710
How dare you trick me?

33:11.110 --> 33:12.200
So what if I did?

33:13.270 --> 33:14.030
Apologize to me.

33:14.030 --> 33:15.200
Sorry.

33:15.550 --> 33:16.750
Not sincere enough.

33:20.960 --> 33:24.880
Sorry, King Lin Zeqiu.

33:25.960 --> 33:27.400
That's more like it.

33:28.440 --> 33:29.480
I forgive you.

33:29.920 --> 33:30.880
Let's draw it again.

33:30.880 --> 33:33.080
You erased the deer I drew when I was six.

33:33.830 --> 33:35.400
Look, I didn't erase it.

33:35.980 --> 33:38.000
You deliberately
rubbed against the wall just now,

33:38.000 --> 33:39.510
-not the painting, right?
-Yeah.

33:39.510 --> 33:40.830
You are so smart.

33:40.880 --> 33:42.000
I am so silly.

33:42.030 --> 33:43.440
I'm really so silly.

33:44.200 --> 33:45.460
I totally missed that.

33:49.480 --> 33:51.080
A little piece fell off here.

34:04.720 --> 34:05.780
Morning, Grandma.

34:06.110 --> 34:06.750
Morning.

34:08.880 --> 34:10.409
Heading to school, Zhixia?

34:10.510 --> 34:11.550
Morning, Grandma Leng.

34:11.550 --> 34:12.190
Morning.

34:14.920 --> 34:16.280
You just love teasing it.

34:16.280 --> 34:17.590
Did you feed it?

34:18.710 --> 34:20.000
I did.

34:37.840 --> 34:39.440
Keep a distance of 10 meters.

34:39.480 --> 34:40.360
Don't talk to me.

34:40.360 --> 34:41.550
No eye contact.

34:41.550 --> 34:43.409
Don't let others misunderstand.

35:01.230 --> 35:02.030
Lin Zhixia.

35:02.960 --> 35:04.220
Can you come to my side?

35:07.440 --> 35:08.480
I don't have eyes on the back of my head.

35:08.480 --> 35:09.590
How can I watch you?

35:12.800 --> 35:13.480
Come here.

35:24.940 --> 35:25.630
Let's go.

35:33.910 --> 35:34.760
Lin Zeqiu.

35:34.760 --> 35:35.710
Is that Lin Zeqiu?

35:35.710 --> 35:36.440
Yeah.

35:36.760 --> 35:38.890
What's going on? Let's go check it out.

35:40.320 --> 35:41.110
Lin Zeqiu.

35:43.280 --> 35:44.070
Lin Zhixia.

35:44.480 --> 35:45.190
Come here.

35:45.920 --> 35:46.630
Come here.

35:48.030 --> 35:50.070
Lin Zhixia is my sister.

35:51.590 --> 35:52.850
Lin Zeqiu. Lin Zhixia.

35:53.400 --> 35:54.920
No wonder the names are so similar.

35:54.920 --> 35:55.840
Sorry.

35:56.070 --> 35:57.590
Your sister is just too outstanding.

35:57.590 --> 35:58.960
So we really couldn't

35:58.960 --> 36:00.360
associate you two together.

36:00.360 --> 36:01.960
A well-known top student in school...

36:01.960 --> 36:04.480
And an unknown ordinary person.

36:05.760 --> 36:06.800
Are you blood-related?

36:06.800 --> 36:07.920
Were you adopted?

36:09.590 --> 36:12.120
Even if he was adopted,
he's still my brother.

36:13.190 --> 36:14.360
We're blood-related.

36:14.360 --> 36:15.620
We're blood-related.

36:15.960 --> 36:17.280
Why are you disowning me?

36:17.280 --> 36:18.410
Human intelligence

36:18.550 --> 36:20.550
is 40 to 60 percent innate.

36:20.590 --> 36:22.250
And statistically speaking,

36:22.280 --> 36:24.550
I probably benefited from
the law of conservation.

36:24.550 --> 36:26.320
My brother might not be a genius,

36:26.320 --> 36:27.780
but he is very persistent.

36:29.030 --> 36:31.360
There was a math problem
that wasn't too hard before,

36:31.360 --> 36:33.070
but he refused to let me help him with it.

36:33.070 --> 36:35.000
He locked himself in his room
for two nights

36:35.000 --> 36:36.530
and finally figured it out.

36:38.670 --> 36:41.200
What about you?
Are you as hardworking as him?

36:44.440 --> 36:46.240
Are you sure you're praising me?

36:52.360 --> 36:54.560
Although my brother always yells at me,

36:55.070 --> 36:55.920
I know

36:56.230 --> 36:57.630
he always cares about me.

36:57.920 --> 36:59.590
He'd give me his pocket money,

37:00.510 --> 37:01.960
claiming it was from my dad.

37:01.960 --> 37:04.710
My mom keeps track of
our family store's inventory.

37:04.710 --> 37:07.110
Every time he snuck strawberry milk for me

37:07.150 --> 37:08.480
and got caught by my mom,

37:08.550 --> 37:10.170
he'd take the blame
and say he wanted it himself.

37:10.170 --> 37:12.310
He took a lot of beatings for that.

37:12.880 --> 37:14.440
When I ran a fever,

37:14.590 --> 37:16.320
he'd quietly stand guard outside my room.

37:16.320 --> 37:17.550
If anything happened,

37:17.550 --> 37:19.280
he'd rush in right away.

37:20.150 --> 37:21.230
He even washed

37:21.420 --> 37:22.960
my stuffed animals for me.

37:22.980 --> 37:23.880
What about you?

37:24.280 --> 37:26.010
Do you have such a good brother?

37:31.440 --> 37:32.880
Can you hear it?

37:33.280 --> 37:34.070
No, I can't.

37:35.630 --> 37:37.560
All right, we're just teasing you.

37:37.860 --> 37:38.670
Go ahead.

37:41.510 --> 37:42.040
Bye-bye.

37:43.510 --> 37:45.480
So your family runs a grocery store?

37:45.480 --> 37:46.980
Does that mean you have unlimited snacks

37:46.980 --> 37:47.650
and drinks?

37:47.920 --> 37:48.960
I'm so jealous!

37:49.920 --> 37:50.780
Do you guys ever catch the point

37:50.780 --> 37:52.110
when people are talking?

37:52.110 --> 37:54.070
Actually, your sister is quite cute.

37:54.070 --> 37:55.730
I wish I had such a cute sister.

37:56.280 --> 37:58.610
You actually washed her stuffed animals?

38:37.630 --> 38:41.670
[Gold Award: Best Brother of the Nation]

38:48.640 --> 38:52.580
[Gold Award: Best Brother of the Nation]
